sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant ResetView as Reset Password View
    participant ConfirmView as Reset Confirm View
    participant Account as AccountController
    participant Token as AuthTokenHelper
    participant Password as PasswordHelper
    participant Mail as EmailNotificationService
    participant DB as Database

    User->>ResetView: Enter account email
    ResetView->>Account: POST /Account/ResetPassword
    Account->>DB: Find user by email
    DB-->>Account: User record
    Account->>Token: Create reset token
    Token-->>Account: Token + hash
    Account->>DB: Save reset token hash + expiry
    DB-->>Account: Updated
    Account->>Mail: Send reset link
    Mail-->>Account: Sent / Failed
    Account-->>ResetView: Redirect with status/fallback link

    User->>ConfirmView: Open reset link
    ConfirmView->>Account: GET /Account/ResetPasswordConfirm
    Account->>Token: Hash incoming token
    Token-->>Account: Token hash
    Account->>DB: Validate token hash + expiry
    DB-->>Account: User record
    Account-->>ConfirmView: Show reset form

    User->>ConfirmView: Submit new password
    ConfirmView->>Account: POST /Account/ResetPasswordConfirm
    Account->>Password: Hash new password
    Password-->>Account: Password hash
    Account->>DB: Update password, clear reset token
    DB-->>Account: Updated
    Account-->>ResetView: Redirect to login
